name pst-am
category Package
revision 19591
shortdesc Simulation of modulation and demodulation
longdesc The package allows the simulation of the modulated and
longdesc demodulated amplitude of radio waves. The user may plot curves
longdesc of modulated signals, wave carrier, signal modulation, signal
longdesc recovery and signal demodulation.
